          "settings": {
            "question": "What are Bing Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>Bing Ads, now known as Microsoft Advertising, is Microsoft's pay-per-click (PPC) advertising platform. It allows businesses to display ads on the Bing search engine and its partner networks, including Yahoo and AOL.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_AdgFRX": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do Bing Ads differ from Google Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>While both platforms offer PPC advertising, Bing Ads often have lower competition and cost-per-click (CPC) rates. Additionally, Bing's audience tends to be older and more affluent, which can be advantageous for certain businesses.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_E6VP9h": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Bing Ads suitable for small businesses?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. Bing Ads can be particularly effective for small businesses targeting specific demographics or looking for cost-effective advertising solutions.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_akFz96": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I import my Google Ads campaigns into Bing Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, Bing Ads offers a feature that allows you to import your existing Google Ads campaigns, making the transition seamless.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jdQR46": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What types of ads can I run on Bing?",
            "answer": "<p>Bing supports various ad formats, including text ads, shopping ads, and dynamic search ads, catering to both service-based and e-commerce businesses.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_nyFTVE": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does Bing Ads' audience differ from Google's?",
            "answer": "<p>Bing's user base often includes older, more educated, and higher-income individuals. This demographic can be particularly beneficial for businesses targeting such audiences.​</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XN9Db9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Bing Ads effective for e-commerce businesses?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, especially for those using platforms like Shopify. Bing's shopping ads can drive high-quality traffic to your online store.​</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_C7MHEi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I track the performance of my Bing Ads campaigns?",
            "answer": "<p>Bing Ads provides robust analytics tools that allow you to monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) such as click-through rates (CTR), conversions, and return on investment (ROI).​</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
